art with an  initial value of 40  here and now i've got 5 times 40  in the output so that's just kind of a  neat side note that you'll notice as i'm  kind of going through more examples some  of these will just run purely in the  browser um but you could learn more  about that in another video currently i  don't i don't know if this link will  change at any point i would imagine that  it will eventually  have  the company's branding and everything in  the link name  but for now yes pyshiny.netify.app  is the best place to go to and then  there's kind of some get getting started  stuff  some information on how to install  information about how to deploy to our  different like professional products  going into some concepts in depth  and then there's a link here to examples  that  is kind of a different site with all  sorts of different examples that are  running in the browser  [Music]

